<view class="page">
  <view class="topbar"><view class="brand"><view class="brand-mark">上</view><text>产品资料录入</text></view><view class="capsule">本机草稿</view></view>
  <view class="stepper"><view class="step active"><view class="step-dot">1</view><text>产品资料</text></view><view class="step"><view class="step-dot">2</view><text>生成方案</text></view><view class="step"><view class="step-dot">3</view><text>核对导出</text></view></view>
  <view class="notice tip"><text class="tip-title">拍摄建议</text><text>让产品和铭牌完整入镜，避免强反光与遮挡。当前版本不会自动读取铭牌，请按实物资料填写下方信息。</text></view>
  <view class="card upload-card">
    <view class="card-heading"><view><view class="section-title">产品原图</view><view class="muted">支持 PNG / JPEG，最大 5MB</view></view><view wx:if="{{imagePath}}" class="success-tag">✓ 已选择</view></view>
    <view class="uploader {{imagePath ? 'has-image' : ''}}" role="button" aria-label="选择产品图片" hover-class="tap-active" bindtap="chooseImage"><image wx:if="{{imagePath}}" src="{{imagePath}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view wx:else class="empty-upload"><view class="plus">＋</view><view class="upload-title">拍摄或从相册选择</view><view class="muted">主体完整 · 对焦清晰 · 背景简洁</view></view><view wx:if="{{imagePath}}" class="replace">↻ 更换原图</view></view>
    <view class="privacy-line">仅在点击“生成产品套图”后上传，请勿使用含客户敏感信息的图片。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="field-card"><text class="label">产品名称 / 型号 <text class="required">*</text></text><input class="input" maxlength="30" placeholder="例如：SX-18 光电传感器" value="{{name}}" bindinput="onName"/><view class="counter">{{name.length}} / 30</view></view>
  <view class="field-card"><text class="label">参考报价 <text class="optional">选填</text></text><view class="price-field"><text>¥</text><input class="input" type="digit" placeholder="1280.00" value="{{price}}" bindinput="onPrice"/></view><view class="muted helper">不填写时，渠道海报将显示“欢迎咨询”</view></view>
  <view class="field-card"><text class="label">行动按钮文案 <text class="optional">选填，最多 12 字</text></text><input class="input" maxlength="12" placeholder="例如：获取报价 / 查看参数" value="{{promotionText}}" bindinput="onPromotion"/><view class="counter">{{promotionText.length}} / 12</view></view>
  <view class="field-card"><text class="label">企业 / 品牌标识 <text class="optional">选填，最多 12 字</text></text><input class="input" maxlength="12" placeholder="例如：上新智造" value="{{brandName}}" bindinput="onBrandName"/><view class="brand-colors"><view wx:for="{{brandColors}}" wx:key="*this" class="brand-color {{brandColor === item ? 'active' : ''}}" role="button" aria-label="选择品牌色 {{item}}" style="background:{{item}}" data-color="{{item}}" bindtap="selectBrandColor">{{brandColor === item ? '✓' : ''}}</view></view></view>
  <view class="field-card"><text class="label">关键参数 / 卖点 <text class="optional">最多 3 条，每条 20 字</text></text><view class="feature-input"><input class="input" maxlength="20" placeholder="例如：IP67 防护 / 10–30V DC" value="{{featureText}}" bindinput="onFeature" confirm-type="done" bindconfirm="addFeature"/><button bindtap="addFeature">添加</button></view><view class="chips"><view class="chip active" wx:for="{{features}}" wx:key="index" data-index="{{index}}" role="button" aria-label="删除参数 {{item}}" bindtap="removeFeature">{{item}} ×</view></view><view class="muted helper">建议填写可从产品资料中核对的规格；点击已添加项可删除。</view></view>
  <view class="bottom-action"><button class="primary" bindtap="next">下一步，配置生成方案 →</button></view>
</view>
